  <h2 id="workspace-rules">Workspace rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use Bun and the root <code>bun.lock</code>.</li>
    <li>Keep Convex functions in <code>packages/backend</code>.</li>
    <li>Validate identity, ownership, limits, and economy rules on the server.</li>
    <li>Keep first-focus proposals unpersisted until the user confirms.</li>
  </ul>

